.gpt-6.1-sol.findings.md).\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9770:  gpt-6.1-sol gate; (2) same for C2-S2 (lanes are the missing evidence), then\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9783:Next: as in the brief: finish lanes, fresh gpt-6.1-sol gates for round 5 and C2-S2, land, mob the float-address question, then safepoint s2 / C3-S2.\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9803:Next: (1) dispatch the fresh gpt-6.1-sol Stage 1 R5 gate (concurrent);\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9893:Next: harvest lanes.sh c2s2 results -> glm static gate + gpt-6.1-sol final gate on C2-S2 -> land; redispatch\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9930:  running the c2s2 legs in datomworld-py-c2gen1; harvest when done, then glm static + gpt-6.1-sol final gates.\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9979:  tests + portable parity tests, CPython 3.9.6-verified. Gates: the claude seat's gpt-6.1-sol r1 REQUEST CHANGES\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9984:  READY with CPython ground truth; gpt-6.1-sol r2 (resumed thread) READY — both fixes verified closed. Committed\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:9988:Verification: full protocol — my lanes + two independent gates (glm-family subagent + gpt-6.1-sol).\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:10000:  all-pass; glm-family subagent static gate READY; gpt-6.1-sol thread 01a0fe49 r1 REQUEST CHANGES -> fixes -> r2\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:10014:   orchestrator lanes were killed as moot), subagent static gate, gpt-6.1-sol gate, land FIRST.\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:10027:   NEXT: orchestrator lanes, subagent static gate, gpt-6.1-sol gate, land.\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:10033:  gate + gpt-6.1-sol gate -> commit in the worktree -> rebase -> ff master FROM THE MAIN TREE -> push.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
